 "}, {"text": "Nucleic acid amplification tests (NAATs) from urine or swabs (urethral, cervical, rectal, or oropharyngeal "}, {"text": "sites)."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1370"}}, {"id": "body-12061", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "If NAAT unavailable: Gram stain (limited sensitivity), culture, or ELISA where available.", "runs": [{"text": "If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "NAAT"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "unavailable:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Gram"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stain"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(limited"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sensitivity),"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "culture,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ELISA"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "where"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "available."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1370"}}, {"id": "body-12062", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "In resource-limited settings, syndromic management based on symptoms is recommended.", "runs": [{"text": "In"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "resource-limited"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "settings,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "syndromic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "management"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "based"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "symptoms"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "recommended."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1370"}}, {"id": "body-12065", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-12066", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Non-pregnant adults and adolescents", "runs": [{"text": "Non-pregnant"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "adults"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "adolescents"}]}, {"id": "body-12067", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "A: doxycycline (PO) 100mg 12hourly for 7 days", "runs": [{"text": "A:", "bold": true